---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { nom, nif, adreca, email, ciutat, dataRevisio } from '../../../data/empresa';
---

<Layout title="Legal Notice">
  <style is:global>
    .doc-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      color: #1a1a1a;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .doc-card h1 {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .doc-card h2 {
      color: #2c3e50;
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .doc-card p, .doc-card li {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .doc-card a {
      color: #1a73e8;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .doc-card .highlight {
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-left: 6px solid #3498db;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .doc-card .footer {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #555;
      border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .doc-card { padding: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="doc-card">
    <h1>Legal Notice</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {dataRevisio}</p>

    <div class="highlight">
      <h2>1. Identification of the responsible party</h2>
      <p>In compliance with Law 34/2002, of July 11, on information society services and electronic commerce (LSSI), the following information is provided:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Responsible:</strong> {nom}</li>
        <li><strong>Tax ID (NIF):</strong> {nif}</li>
        <li><strong>Registered address:</strong> {adreca}</li>
        <li><strong>Contact email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>2. Intellectual and industrial property</h2>
    <p>All contents of this application (texts, designs, source code, logos, icons, images, and software) are the property of {nom} or its licensors, and are protected by intellectual and industrial property laws.</p>
    <p>Reproduction, distribution, modification, or public communication without the prior written authorization of the owner is prohibited.</p>

    <h2>3. Terms of use</h2>
    <p>The user agrees to use the application appropriately, respecting current legislation and third-party rights. Use of the application for illegal or harmful purposes is strictly prohibited.</p>

    <h2>4. Applicable law and jurisdiction</h2>
    <p>Relations arising from the use of this application are governed by Spanish law. For any dispute, the parties submit to the courts of the city of {ciutat}, expressly waiving any other jurisdiction that may correspond to them.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {dataRevisio} - {nom}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>